      "description": "Postdoctoral Scholar Series in Biomedical Sciences - Open Rank (JPF02333) - AP Recruit Skip to main content Recruit Home Open Recruitments Postdoctoral Scholar Series in Biomedical Sciences - Open Rank (JPF02333) Postdoctoral Scholar Series in Biomedical Sciences - Open Rank Apply now to Postdoctoral Scholar Series in Biomedical Sciences - Open Rank Job #JPF02333 Biomedical Sciences / School of Medicine / UC Riverside Position overview Position title: Postdoctoral Scholar - Employee, Fellow, Paid Direct, or Employee Non-Exempt Salary range: The posted UC salary scales UCOP compensation index set the minimum pay determined by rank and step at appointment.\n\nSee Table 23 for the Postdoctoral Scholar (Employee, Fellow, Paid Direct) salary range, the base salary range for these positions is $69,073 - $82,836. See Table 23N for the Postdoctoral Scholar (employee, non-exempt) salary range, the base salary range for this position is $33.09 - $39.68 hourly. Application Window Open date: August 12, 2026 Most recent review date: Wednesday, Aug 26, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications received after this date will be reviewed by the search committee if the position has not yet been filled. Final date: Wednesday, Jun 30, 2027 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications will continue to be accepted until this date, but those received after the review date will only be considered if the position has not yet been filled. Position description Postdoctoral Scholar positions are occasionally available throughout the year in the Division of Biomedical Sciences in the School of Medicine at the University of California, Riverside. The Division is conducting an open search for Postdoctoral Scholars in various disciplines. Positions are filled as they become available based on the funds and priorities of different laboratories or research centers. Initial appointment for Postdoctoral Scholars is for two years, and renewal is based on availability of support. Succe